        <mxCell id="Gp1_GEWc60zfC_XgsBu2-8" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;This graphical representation visualizes the statistical logic you&#39;ve defined. It clearly shows how the &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;104&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;20% threshold&lt;/b&gt; is not an arbitrary number, but a deliberate selection based on identifying outliers in a skewed customer population.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Return Rate Distribution and Outlier Detection&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;The chart below illustrates the return rate distribution of B2C US customers:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; style=&quot;padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;The Curve:&lt;/b&gt; Shows a typical &quot;Long Tail&quot; distribution where most customers have very low return rates (the peak), while a small number of customers have significantly higher rates (the tail to the right).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;The Box (IQR):&lt;/b&gt; Highlights the middle 50% of your customers (&lt;span class=&quot;math-inline&quot; data-math=&quot;0.4\%&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;60&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;$0.4\%$&lt;/span&gt; to &lt;span class=&quot;math-inline&quot; data-math=&quot;7.8\%&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;69&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;$7.8\%$&lt;/span&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;The Statistical Fence:&lt;/b&gt; The red line at &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;39&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;18.9%&lt;/b&gt; represents the traditional outlier boundary (&lt;span class=&quot;math-inline&quot; data-math=&quot;Q_3 + 1.5 \times IQR&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;90&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;$Q_3 + 1.5 \times IQR$&lt;/span&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;The High-Impact Segment:&lt;/b&gt; The dark red area starting at &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;55&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;20%&lt;/b&gt; identifies the specific &quot;High Return Rate&quot; customers targeted by your project.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="240" width="630" x="-810" y="330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
